 "official_summary": " <p><b>Honoring American Veterans in Extreme Need Act of 2019 or the HAVEN Act</b></p> <p>This bill modifies the treatment of certain veterans' benefits in bankruptcy.</p> <p>Specifically, the bill excludes from a debtor's current monthly income certain benefits, including disability benefits, paid by the Department of Veterans Affairs or the Department of Defense.</p>",
